      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1742657220849,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "playing around with\ntemperature. \nmultiply by a scale all the\nprobability values before\napplying softmax. lower\ntemperature means gap\nbetween max and other\ntokens are high and thus\nmore confident prediction.\nhigher temperature means\ngap is lower and thus\nmore diverse prediction\npossibility",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "playing around with temperature. \nmultiply by a scale all the probability values before applying softmax. lower temperature means gap between max and other tokens are high and thus more confident prediction. higher temperature means gap is lower and thus more diverse prediction possibility",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
